WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.503
-Welcome back, guys. It is time
for "Tonight Show Hashtags."

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:04.637
Here we go.

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:08.942
♪ -Hashtags ♪

00:00:08.942 --> 00:00:12.879
♪ Hashtags ♪

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:16.015
-We do this thing every week
where I send out a hashtag

00:00:16.015 --> 00:00:18.117
and ask you guys
to respond to that topic.

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:20.053
So since Mother's Day
is this weekend,

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:22.522
I sent out
the hashtag #MomQuotes

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:25.124
and asked you guys to tweet out
a funny or weird thing

00:00:25.124 --> 00:00:26.826
your mom has said.

00:00:26.826 --> 00:00:29.028
Within minutes,
it was a trending topic.

00:00:29.028 --> 00:00:31.064
So thank you
for playing along with us.

00:00:31.064 --> 00:00:33.166
We love it
when you guys play along.

00:00:33.166 --> 00:00:34.667
Now I'd like to share
some of my favorite

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:36.402
mom quotes from you guys.

00:00:36.402 --> 00:00:39.839
I was just thinking about
one of my mom's stories I had.

00:00:39.839 --> 00:00:42.242
I was in the hospital
because I had --

00:00:42.242 --> 00:00:43.843
my finger almost got ripped off.

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:45.577
So I was in the ICU
for like 10 days.

00:00:45.577 --> 00:00:46.612
My mom came to visit.

00:00:46.612 --> 00:00:48.714
You know, I had
oxygen all over --

00:00:48.714 --> 00:00:50.116
something happened
with this hand.

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:52.452
It was all bandaged up.
This one has tubes everywhere.

00:00:52.452 --> 00:00:55.454
My mom comes in,
and she puts a giant bag

00:00:55.454 --> 00:00:58.157
of individually wrapped
Life Savers on my chest.

00:00:58.157 --> 00:01:03.062
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.062 --> 00:01:05.064
What kind of sick torture
is this?

00:01:05.064 --> 00:01:06.365
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.365 --> 00:01:08.134
She goes,
"I actually got them for me.

00:01:08.134 --> 00:01:10.102
That's my favorite,
Life Savers."

00:01:10.102 --> 00:01:12.438
You bring your own snacks to go
visit someone at the hospital?

00:01:12.438 --> 00:01:14.607
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:17.009
Unbelievable.
-Individually wrapped.

00:01:17.009 --> 00:01:20.346
-This one's from -- first one's
from @edwardschmidtii.

00:01:20.346 --> 00:01:24.017
He says, "My mom can never get
the name Papa John's correct.

00:01:24.017 --> 00:01:25.351
The most famous names she's said

00:01:25.351 --> 00:01:28.153
were Magic Jack's
and Dr. Domino's."

00:01:28.153 --> 00:01:29.322
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:29.322 --> 00:01:32.691
Magic Jack's?

00:01:32.691 --> 00:01:35.361
Let's get pizza
from Magic Jack's.

00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:37.263
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.263 --> 00:01:39.332
This one's from @helloclaryyce.

00:01:39.332 --> 00:01:43.136
-Hmm. [ Slurps ]

00:01:43.136 --> 00:01:45.371
-She says,
"Every time we'd watch a VHS

00:01:45.371 --> 00:01:46.639
when I was growing up, it said

00:01:46.639 --> 00:01:48.908
'This film has been modified
to fit your screen.'

00:01:48.908 --> 00:01:51.544
My mom would say, 'How did
they know how big our TV was?'

00:01:51.544 --> 00:01:54.681
Every time."
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:54.681 --> 00:01:57.883
-Good point.

00:01:57.883 --> 00:01:59.886
-This one is
from @bdwaybrooke.

00:01:59.886 --> 00:02:02.755
She says, "Someone annoyed
my mom in the grocery store.

00:02:02.755 --> 00:02:04.857
So she said to them, 'Excuse me.

00:02:04.857 --> 00:02:07.560
Can you please tell me what
aisle the manners are in?'"

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:09.028
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.028 --> 00:02:10.530
-Yeah!
-"Savage moment."

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:12.465
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Nice. Savage.

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:15.301
-Can you tell me what aisle
the manners are in?!

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:19.639
-Mm!
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.639 --> 00:02:22.141
-That's the way my mom
would act when she was --

00:02:22.141 --> 00:02:24.577
She would over-pronounce words.

00:02:24.577 --> 00:02:27.346
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.346 --> 00:02:30.449
This one's
from @steveaustin1984.

00:02:30.449 --> 00:02:33.352
He says, "One time my mom texted
me, 'Where is your phone?'"

00:02:33.352 --> 00:02:37.724
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:37.724 --> 00:02:40.159
When I find it,
I will let you know.

00:02:40.159 --> 00:02:42.394
[ Laughter ]
-Do you have it?

00:02:42.394 --> 00:02:44.864
-This next one is from
the very funny friend of ours,

00:02:44.864 --> 00:02:46.265
Mike Birbiglia.
-Ah.

00:02:46.265 --> 00:02:48.067
-He says, "When I was
in my parents' local paper,

00:02:48.067 --> 00:02:50.336
'The Cape Cod Times,'
my mom said,

00:02:50.336 --> 00:02:52.038
'There must not be
a lot going on.'"

00:02:52.038 --> 00:02:54.340
[ Laughter ]
"Thanks, Mom."

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:55.842
[ Applause ]

00:02:55.842 --> 00:02:58.978
-Thanks, Mike's mom.
-Slow news day.

00:02:58.978 --> 00:03:01.780
-This one is
from @marisarosie22.

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:04.817
She says, "I told my mom she was
invading my personal space,

00:03:04.817 --> 00:03:07.153
and she said I came out
of her personal space."

00:03:07.153 --> 00:03:08.554
[ Laughter ]

00:03:08.554 --> 00:03:09.822
"I just looked at her
and said okay."

00:03:09.822 --> 00:03:11.357
[ Applause ]

00:03:11.357 --> 00:03:14.593
-Wow! That's -- That's just --
-Not bad.

00:03:14.593 --> 00:03:16.195
-That's a savage burn.

00:03:16.195 --> 00:03:18.831
-This one is from @orangefloyd.

00:03:18.831 --> 00:03:21.534
She says, "When my 90-year-old
mom was in the hospital

00:03:21.534 --> 00:03:24.003
last year, I asked if any of
her friends had contacted her,

00:03:24.003 --> 00:03:26.238
and she said,
'No, all my friends suck.'"

00:03:26.238 --> 00:03:28.174
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:28.174 --> 00:03:32.611
She's 90 years old.

00:03:32.611 --> 00:03:35.448
-They do.
-All my friends suck.

00:03:35.448 --> 00:03:37.483
This last one's
from @itsmelpresta.

00:03:37.483 --> 00:03:39.385
She says, "I was taking my mom
for a drive

00:03:39.385 --> 00:03:41.687
through the neighborhood I was
moving into when she shouted,

00:03:41.687 --> 00:03:44.290
'Wow, that La Fitness gym
is huge.'

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:47.092
It's L.A. Fitness, Mom.
I love you so much."

00:03:47.092 --> 00:03:49.528
There you have it. Those are
our "Tonight Show Hashtags."

00:03:49.528 --> 00:03:50.963
To check out
more of our favorites,

00:03:50.963 --> 00:03:53.099
go to tonightshow.com/hashtags.

